k4SimGeant4: Avoid G4SystemOfUnits.hh.

G4SystemOfUnits.hh brings the names of all units into the global namespace.
This pollution of common names (like s and m) can then result in -Wshadow
warnings from clang.

Use CLHEP/Units/SystemOfUnits.h instead, with explicit namespace
qualifications where needed.
